# A GUI that shows every kind the cluster has cannot enumerate them in advance,
# so the chart's default read role is get/list/watch on everything. rbac.read
# can be set to workloads for a curated list without secrets; both are in
# docs/cluster-mode.md, and neither grants any write verb.
KSV-0046

# No cpu limit on purpose: throttling a process that keeps informer caches in
# step with the apiserver makes it fall behind rather than use less. The memory
# limit is set.
KSV-0011

# ghcr.io is where spinoza publishes its own image.
KSV-0125
